[gd_scene load_steps=3 format=3]

; The room check, holding the SHIPPED room inside it - which holds the shipped table, which holds
; the board, the tray, the DM, the companion and the sheet. Same shape as the fight check and for
; the same reason: the thing measured has to be the thing played.
;
; It boots the room, walks the objects, fills the sheet in by touching its blanks, proves the dice
; follow what was written, and takes a box off the shelf. And it greps the whole build for a menu,
; a panel or a modal, which is the half of R5's verify list a machine can do better than a person.
;
; Run it with check-room.ps1.

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://Diagnostics/RoomCheck.cs" id="1_check"]
[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://room.tscn" id="2_room"]

[node name="RoomCheck" type="Node"]
script = ExtResource("1_check")
TheRoom = ExtResource("2_room")
